// Source 1 (same as Target Tracker): subjects of your newest Torn messages via API v2 user/messages (Limited Access key). Nothing is opened or marked read.
// Source 2: new lines that appear in Torn's chat on this page (read only). Only lines added after the page loaded count.
const CALL_MSG_MIN = 3, CALL_MSG_MAX = 60;
